DATASET NAME - E-Commerce Transactions Dataset
SOURCE  AND URL - https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/smayanj/e-commerce-transactions-dataset
​Number of rows and columns: 50,000 rows, 8 columns

Brief description of the dataset: This dataset contains 50,000 e-commerce transaction records. Key fields include Transaction ID, User Name, Age, Country, Product Category, Purchase Amount, Payment Method, and Transaction Date.

Why you selected this dataset: It meets the minimum threshold requirement of 50,000+ records while providing transactional details ideal for evaluating purchase behavior, profitability across product categories, and regional sales performance.

What business opportunities or problems you believe the dataset could help investigate:
​Revenue tracking and profit margin sales of product categories.
​High customer drop-off/churn patterns based on transaction frequency.
​Region-wise purchasing power and payment method preferences.
